    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfortunately, online servers and online saving has been taken down. However, saving still works when played locally (Single Player).\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/333bcc1d17b87b5874babbf98dbb8468.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Crawl into the ultimate <strong>co-op RPG lizard simulator</strong>, set in a variety of lush environments ranging from beautiful jungle rainforests to harsh dry savannahs. Grow your lizard to incredible sizes while honing your platforming skills to become the ultimate lizard! <strong>Lizard Quest is unlike anything you\u2019ve seen before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/8e99242a22483890f5f746998daa407f.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Run around and cause an absolute ruckus! Chomp down on local fruit and vegetables to <strong>grow in size and level up</strong>, spend growth points on <strong>upgrading your stats</strong>. From jump height and movement speed to attack damage and chomp rate - there's no limit to your reptilian antics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/7995acfaabebad5c07378cc740075a28.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Challenge your parkour, puzzle-solving, platforming and pillaging abilities! With many <strong>cliffs and mountains to climb, rivers to cross and secret areas to explore</strong> - this ever-expanding world of adventure and excitement is yours for the taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/2cbcd3b3b27dddcc26c19872a00366a7.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Climb in style with an array of different lizard <strong>skins and hats</strong> to dress your Sunday best! With over <strong>10+ hats to discover,</strong> collect and show-off as well as an array of different lizard styles and aesthetics to unlock as you rebirth into new ages - there\u2019s always new room to express yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfortunately, online servers and online saving has been taken down. However, saving still works when played locally (Single Player).\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/333bcc1d17b87b5874babbf98dbb8468.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Crawl into the ultimate <strong>co-op RPG lizard simulator</strong>, set in a variety of lush environments ranging from beautiful jungle rainforests to harsh dry savannahs. Grow your lizard to incredible sizes while honing your platforming skills to become the ultimate lizard! <strong>Lizard Quest is unlike anything you\u2019ve seen before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/8e99242a22483890f5f746998daa407f.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Run around and cause an absolute ruckus! Chomp down on local fruit and vegetables to <strong>grow in size and level up</strong>, spend growth points on <strong>upgrading your stats</strong>. From jump height and movement speed to attack damage and chomp rate - there's no limit to your reptilian antics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/7995acfaabebad5c07378cc740075a28.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Challenge your parkour, puzzle-solving, platforming and pillaging abilities! With many <strong>cliffs and mountains to climb, rivers to cross and secret areas to explore</strong> - this ever-expanding world of adventure and excitement is yours for the taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1979520/extras/2cbcd3b3b27dddcc26c19872a00366a7.avif?t=1751426579\" /></div>Climb in style with an array of different lizard <strong>skins and hats</strong> to dress your Sunday best! With over <strong>10+ hats to discover,</strong> collect and show-off as well as an array of different lizard styles and aesthetics to unlock as you rebirth into new ages - there\u2019s always new room to express yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
